              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Duma malagho kwa wandu wose widwalo wunyika kughambe kukaia, ‘BWANA waghamba huwu aighu ya Shemaia Mnehelami: Kwa kukaia Shemaia wamfunyire wulodi nisemdumie, hata ukam'bonya inyo mrumirie tee, ",
          "type": "text",
