        {
          "text": "nichamkaba Shemaia Mnehelami na kivalwa chake chose; ndechaakaia na mndungi odua moyo aghadi ya awa wandu, na kuwona iro maza ndicha nichaawibonyera wandu wapo, kwa kukaia wadeda malagho ghewibonya winileghe.’”",
          "type": "text",
